  License:   CC0 1.0 Universal for the library (full text in src/icons/simple-icons/LICENSE). Simple Icons states that this does not
             mean every icon is CC0, so the icons that carry their own license are listed below.
  Files:     src/icons/simple-icons/*.svg (32 icons, listed by brand name in src/icons/brands.json)
  Modified:  color only. The root svg element gets fill="currentColor" so the figure draws every mark in one text color role token,
             never the brand color. The shapes are unchanged.
  Per-icon licenses:
